<Base lang="en" title="Caldrew | Approach" description="How Caldrew invests: Iberian companies in fragmented sectors, acquired as platforms and built through disciplined consolidation.">
<section class="cd-page-header"><div class="cd-container"><p class="cd-eyebrow">Approach</p><h1 class="cd-page-title">How we invest, what we build, and why Iberia.</h1></div></section><section class="cd-numbered"><div class="cd-container"><div class="cd-numbered-grid"><div><span class="cd-num">01</span><h2 class="cd-num-title">Where we invest</h2></div><div class="cd-prose-box"><p class="cd-prose">We invest in Iberia, with Southern Europe as the broader horizon. We look for established, profitable, founder-led companies at the smaller end of the mid-market, in sectors where ownership is fragmented and no clear leader has emerged.</p><p class="cd-prose-last">These are good businesses, often built over a generation, that have reached the limits of what one owner can do alone.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="cd-numbered"><div class="cd-container"><div class="cd-numbered-grid"><div><span class="cd-num">02</span><h2 class="cd-num-title">What we do</h2></div><div class="cd-prose-box"><p class="cd-prose">We acquire a platform business and build it through disciplined add-on acquisitions. As the group grows, we professionalise operations, governance and systems.</p><p class="cd-prose-last">The aim is a larger, stronger company. Growth through consolidation, not financial engineering.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="cd-numbered"><div class="cd-container"><div class="cd-numbered-grid"><div><span class="cd-num">03</span><h2 class="cd-num-title">Why Iberia</h2></div><div class="cd-prose-box"><p class="cd-prose">Three things draw us here. Industrial and services markets remain fragmented. A generation of founders is reaching succession with no obvious buyer. And there is a persistent gap between what small companies and larger ones are worth.</p><p class="cd-prose-last">Patient consolidation closes that gap.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="cd-numbered"><div class="cd-container"><div class="cd-numbered-grid"><div><span class="cd-num">04</span><h2 class="cd-num-title">How we work</h2></div><div class="cd-prose-box"><p class="cd-prose">We think like owners, because we are owners. We hold for the long term and work in partnership with management. Our partners have run and sold companies themselves.</p><p class="cd-prose-last">Decisions are direct and unbureaucratic. The people you meet are the people who decide.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="cd-closing"><div class="cd-container"><p class="cd-closing-line">If you own a business we should know about, we would like to hear from you.</p><a href="/contact" class="cd-cta-tight">Get in touch</a></div></section>
</Base>
